  "reason": "The third run this map steered: route svm, live/madelon-route-svm, built on the same cited results and screen code as knn, and following rev-3's rule: no script it ran reads data/heldout.csv except the final analysis.py, which never ran. Capture stopped the session at its ceiling of 2,000,000 tokens (step-35), one step before the planned one-shot held-out score. No observation measured holdout_auc, so nothing on the route resolves. The route is abandoned rather than refuted: the pilot evidence and the agent's own expectation say it would miss, and this was the last of the three runs the plan allowed. With that, every route to compact is blocked or abandoned: the pilot-only designs' one held-out score was 0.6989 for screened-forest and 0.709 for knn, against 0.71, and the passes that cleared it came after a held-out miss. The goal compact is not reached on this evidence. floor-forest and floor-l1 stay open, on routes to the goal floor, which is already reached.",
